        <para id="element-538">Calculate the following:
          <list id="list-2396953" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha">
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">μ<sub>x</sub></emphasis> = _______</item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">σ<sub>x</sub></emphasis> = _______</item>
          </list>
        </para>
        <para id="element-453"><title>Collect the Data</title>Use a random number generator to randomly select four samples of size <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> = 5 from the given population. Record your samples in <link target-id="Ch07_lab2_tbl002" document=""/>. Then, for each sample, calculate the mean to the nearest tenth. Record them in the spaces provided. Record the sample means for the rest of the class.</para>
